{"id":"n16595-1-8","stage":0,"title":"생신 · 寿辰","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16595-1-8-1","ko":"어머니의 생신 선물로 뭐가 좋을까?","zh":"妈妈生日送什么礼物好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"妈妈的","explanation":"어머니：妈妈；-의 表示所属，这里指妈妈的生日。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니의","audio":"/audio/2b010f4ec95e129befff.mp3"}},{"text":"생신","meaning":"生日（敬语）","explanation":"생신：生日的敬语说法，用于称呼母亲等长辈的生日。","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"作为礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；-로 表示用途或身份，这里是“作为生日礼物”。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물로","audio":"/audio/29b159bf8e45509c413a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐가","audio":"/audio/2c57e944c5dd1dbd2cf3.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"合适呢","explanation":"좋다：合适；-을까? 表示自问或征求意见，即“送什么好呢”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"19","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을까","audio":"/audio/2522a45a86bca3387290.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"母亲；这里指说话人的妈妈。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"合适","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"适合某件事情；这里指适合作为生日礼物。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f075f0c26d618373859c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16595-1-8-2","ko":"내 생각에는 화장품이 좋을 것 같은데.","zh":"我觉得化妆品挺合适的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"생각에는","meaning":"在我看来","explanation":"생각：想法；-에 加话题助词 -는，내 생각에는 相当于“在我看来”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각에는","audio":"/audio/5d477f24dbba2af6a6a4.mp3"}},{"text":"화장품이","meaning":"化妆品","explanation":"화장품：化妆品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73232","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장품이","audio":"/audio/f501994f87ac619e2d9d.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을","meaning":"合适","explanation":"좋다：合适；-을 与后面的 것 같다 合用，表示推测。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"19","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을","audio":"/audio/d2aa9b52fc7f57413216.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"会……的样子","explanation":"것：依存名词，和前面的 -을 及后面的 같다 合用，表示“似乎会……”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"似乎呢","explanation":"같다：好像；-은데 在句末委婉地提出自己的看法，留有余地。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，念头，心思","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"740b80a0f4f8ee40","term":"화장품","zh":"化妆品","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3","entryId":"73232","definition":"为了美观或护理皮肤而涂抹在脸上的物品。","pronunciation":["화장품"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"合适","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"适合某件事情；这里指化妆品适合作生日礼物。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"事、情况（推测结构）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"依存名词；与前面的 -을 和后面的 같다 构成推测表达。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/93f211f5808b42a5e2ca.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16595","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/